{"id":"n62802-2-7","stage":3,"title":"삶다 · 哄","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62802-2-7-1","ko":"경쟁 회사에게 공사 계약을 빼앗기다니.","zh":"工程合同竟然被竞争对手抢走了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"경쟁","meaning":"竞争","explanation":"경쟁：竞争","readings":[{"term":"경쟁","audio":"/audio/e0d5713f07b18eba10b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25688","senseId":"1","lemma":"경쟁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경쟁","audio":"/audio/e0d5713f07b18eba10b8.mp3"}},{"text":"회사에게","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사에게","audio":"/audio/81793b1fcf7a0ec3ae7c.mp3"}},{"text":"공사","meaning":"工程，施工","explanation":"공사：工程，施工","readings":[{"term":"공사","audio":"/audio/25e51843741edb403b41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23401","senseId":"1","lemma":"공사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공사","audio":"/audio/25e51843741edb403b41.mp3"}},{"text":"계약을","meaning":"合同，契约，合约","explanation":"계약：合同，契约，合约；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"계약","audio":"/audio/38de236ecca580401830.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17755","senseId":"1","lemma":"계약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계약을","audio":"/audio/6891937399c6feeb0690.mp3"}},{"text":"빼앗기다니.","meaning":"被夺走，被抢","explanation":"빼앗기다：被夺走，被抢；다니：对听到的内容表示惊讶、感叹或反问。","readings":[{"term":"빼앗기다","audio":"/audio/f0cee900853e94496385.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15648","senseId":"1","lemma":"빼앗기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빼앗기다니","audio":"/audio/e7f556c92cc616a3db33.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e0d5713f07b18eba","term":"경쟁","zh":"竞争","audio":"/audio/e0d5713f07b18eba10b8.mp3","entryId":"25688","definition":"为在某个领域取胜或领先而相互较量。","pronunciation":["경ː쟁"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"25e51843741edb40","term":"공사","zh":"工程，施工","audio":"/audio/25e51843741edb403b41.mp3","entryId":"23401","definition":"重新建造或改造设施或建筑物。","pronunciation":["공사"]},{"id":"38de236ecca58040","term":"계약","zh":"合同，契约，合约","audio":"/audio/38de236ecca580401830.mp3","entryId":"17755","definition":"在金钱往来的交易中把互相遵守的义务或责任写在文件上互相约定。","pronunciation":["계ː약","게ː약"]},{"id":"f0cee900853e9449","term":"빼앗기다","zh":"被夺走，被抢","audio":"/audio/f0cee900853e94496385.mp3","entryId":"15648","definition":"原本拥有的东西强制性消失或成为他人所有。","pronunciation":["빼앋끼다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c179c8f2a9a8d99f71f1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62802-2-7-2","ko":"담당자 하나 못 삶아 놓고 뭐했어?","zh":"连一个负责人都没能拉拢过来，你到底在干什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"담당자","meaning":"负责人","explanation":"담당자：负责人","readings":[{"term":"담당자","audio":"/audio/c9cacdac4264cd8d65fc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14002","senseId":"1","lemma":"담당자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"담당자","audio":"/audio/c9cacdac4264cd8d65fc.mp3"}},{"text":"하나","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"삶아","meaning":"哄，买通","explanation":"삶다：哄，买通；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"삶다","audio":"/audio/dd9b86f86267d3ba55a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62802","senseId":"2","lemma":"삶다","origin":"NIKL